  "rules_assessment": [
    "Official HTML incorrectly calls LM-028 Digimon; inspected official PNG explicitly says OPTION and supports the existing context correction.",
    "CR4-22-2 permits a blue Tamer to satisfy blue Option use requirements.",
    "Q4040 rules out treating Rina as the required Digimon evolution base; Main optional evolution does not prevent mandatory subsequent placement. CR1-3-2 performs possible remainder.",
    "A used Option is outside areas until first Main resolves (CR9-1-4); resolve_option places it after optional evolution processing.",
    "Trusted evolution validates active bound effect, source zone, exact binding hashes and enumerated legal route; Q4038 still requires digivolution conditions. No defect identified in this narrow helper review.",
    "Delay is optional and cannot activate during its placement turn (CR16-17). Opponent Digimon processing condition is checked when processing Start of Your Turn effect (CR15-8-3-9).",
    "Q4041 permits Delay activation without blue Digimon trash; Q4042 requires returning one whenever possible. Current choices force that return, then optional trash play only if own battle area has no Digimon. Returned physical copy cannot also be played.",
    "play_blue_scramble_from_trash validates active bound LM-028 Delay in trash, absence of own battle Digimon, blue Digimon type, printed DP at most2000, and effect play at zero cost. No defect found within the loaded contexts."
